#: ../../shopify_catalog_reconciliation.md:125 1695e15233804bbfabb2dd2a868f663a
msgid ""
"Fetch Models, Variations, Units, and Annonces Shopify listings from "
"Airtable (`api.domain.catalog`, built on this project's own "
"`api.services.airtable` functions)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../shopify_catalog_reconciliation.md:128 cb271a1ac52742f3a0926a6705092483
msgid ""
"Fetch every Shopify Product and its Variants in one paginated GraphQL "
"sweep (`api.integrations.shopify.ShopifyCatalog`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../shopify_catalog_reconciliation.md:130 df3cfdddbeec47cc9b0c5c0226f77f21
msgid ""
"Resolve each Model's Shopify product: prefer the linked Annonces Shopify "
"listing's `ID_shopify`, fall back to the Model's own `ShopifyID`, then to"
" a product tagged `airtable-model-<Model record id>` (only the dev-store "
"seeding script sets that tag, since dev-store product ids never match "
"Airtable's production ids -- a no-op in production)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../shopify_catalog_reconciliation.md:135 500c43a84ef741a5b17a13cca218961b
msgid ""
"**Check 1:** for every Model that's `to_sell_on_shopify` and has current "
"stock, is its resolved product id actually one of the fetched Shopify "
"products?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../shopify_catalog_reconciliation.md:137 de35916465a8496da29ad3e9dab9466a
msgid ""
"**Check 2:** for every Variation of a *found* Model that's "
"`to_sell_on_shopify` and has current stock, does that product have any "
"variant whose option values are a superset of the Variation's "
"`Variant_value`?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../shopify_catalog_reconciliation.md:140 6c2e0ded586d4511853d30aa3660d0fd
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Check 3:** group \"A vendre\" units (in a listable condition) of "
"Shopify-bound Variations by `(Variation, Etat esthétique)` -- a unit with"
" no condition is counted in `a_vendre_units_total` but can't be matched "
"to a variant. For each group, does a variant exist whose option values "
"are a superset of `{Variant_value, condition}`? If not, that's a missing "
"variant; if it exists but its `inventoryQuantity` doesn't match the unit "
"count, that's a quantity mismatch."
msgstr ""

#: ../../shopify_catalog_reconciliation.md:146 11f4bc27df644c41aae522a199d32b7a
msgid ""
"Diff the current full set of Model/Variation ids against the previous "
"run's snapshot (stored in Redis, via `api.run_store.RunStore`) to report "
"how many were added since last time (0 on the very first run)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../shopify_catalog_reconciliation.md:149 c657e89898aa461baf342b10fa2d471c
msgid ""
"Enrich `details` (best-effort, never fails the run): Airtable record "
"urls, then the latest `create_product_shopify`/`update_product` attempts "
"(see below)."
